e should be  and how it should play, taking the overused trope of horror as an allegory for  mental illness, and making it something truly memorable.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Checkpoint Gaming<br><br>\u201cBroken Bird Games' debut is a twisting, experimental horror game that goes places you won't see coming.\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 GameSpot<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729740/6dc443e6f5676bc21fc011f5e99987e38c461a6e/ss_6dc443e6f5676bc21fc011f5e99987e38c461a6e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761670807","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729740/6dc443e6f5676bc21fc011f5e99987e38c461a6e/ss_6dc443e6f5676bc21fc011f5e99987e38c461a6e.600x338.jpg?t=1761670807"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729740/fc27fecbdaeda64601c8deba7648892b53eb0e6e/ss_fc27fecbdaeda64601c8deba7648892b53eb0e6e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761670807","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729740/fc27fecbdaeda64601c8deba7648892b53eb0e6e/ss_fc27fecbdaeda64601c8deba7648892b53eb0e6e.600x338.jpg?t=1761670807"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729740/0e8f990eb5f427a5d449af2012435068725e61ac/ss_0e8f990eb5f427a5d449af2012435068725e61ac.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761670807","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729740/0e8f990eb5f427a5d449af2012435068725e61ac/ss_0e8f990eb5f427a5d449af2012435068725e61ac.600x338.jpg?t=1761670807"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729740/cadba68b784303d021bd5e2dc1eb9fd88bda0d5f/ss_cadba68b784303d021bd5e2dc1eb9fd88bda0d5f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761670807","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729740/cadba68b784303d021bd5e2dc1eb9fd88bda0d5f/ss_cadba68b784303d021bd5e2dc1eb9fd88bda0d5f.600x338.jpg?t=1